This project ports patterns from, or builds on, the following works:

- fm-dof-mcp (https://github.com/redznn/fm-dof-mcp, MIT License, license text below): binding-framework read
  patterns (fabricate -> bind -> poll -> collect), native Bindings.Create resolution, the WebSocket server shape,
  and the position bit table used in fm/src/fm_assistant/positions.py.
- cli-anything-fm27 (Apache License 2.0): FM27 save-file parsing, used only by development checks.
- sptndc FM27 BepInEx macOS arm64 loader: required at runtime, not redistributed here.

